WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.960
- Who are you scared 
to fail in front of?

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.960
The reason so many of you are
not doing what you wanna do

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.720
is you're scared 
to fail in something.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.720
You're scared that your
brother will judge you,

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.760
your wife, your girlfriend, 
your husband,

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.600
and most scary, 
your mom or your dad.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.200
You need to eliminate
that, and/or own that fear,

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.440
and put yourself in 
a position to succeed.

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.640
Because with all of this,

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:28.240
with all of this, we are
now in the greatest era.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.120
For the first time ever,
with no fucking money,

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.000
with no god damn connections,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.080
this can put you on the map, 
if you're good enough.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.800
If you are good 
enough to be up here,

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.120
to make bling bling,

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.720
if you are good enough,
nobody's stopping you.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:48.200
Not fucking Donald Trump, not
the fucking Russians, nobody.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:51.200
(audience applause)

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.320
If you are a minority,

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:53.800
if you are a female,

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.280
if you are transgender,

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:59.920
if you're a fucking alien, 
the market doesn't give a fuck.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.160
If you make the 
best shit, you will win.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:09.000
Do you know how sucky it was
to be a nerd 20 years ago?

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.160
But now the market is
rewarding fucking nerds,

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:15.690
and now they're rock stars.

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:18.640
Clap it up if you're 
a fucking nerd.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:22.760
(audience applause and cheers)

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:24.040
The best part about that

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:26.000
was some dude 
was clapping for it,

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.320
and I said, "Clap if
you're a fucking nerd,"

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.480
and he was like...

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:31.198
That's awesome.

00:01:31.198 --> 00:01:33.785
(upbeat music)

